{
  "session": "M0b Session F",
  "what_this_is": "Two cues -- lexical BM25 and the dense ONNX embedder -- fused by MAX OVER PER-CUE CALIBRATED PRECISIONS. The cue set is unchanged from Session C; only the combiner moved. NOT the five-cue system K1 measures; entity-graph, temporal and causal are still absent, so a low number remains a statement about an incomplete cue set.",
